IMPORT prelude

-- A deadline that is not a whole number, followed by an obligation that is
-- entered when it lapses. `l4 explore` lets time pass the 2.5 by waiting until
-- 3.5, and the act that follows is tried there: the clock stands at a fraction
-- although the trace starts at a whole number.

DECLARE Person IS ONE OF P, Q
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF a, b

GIVETH A DEONTIC Person Action
two MEANS
  PARTY P MUST a WITHIN 2.5
  HENCE FULFILLED
  LEST PARTY Q MUST b WITHIN 3
       HENCE PARTY P MUST a WITHIN 4 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH BY P
       LEST BREACH BY Q

#TRACE two AT 0 WITH
  PARTY P DOES a AT 1
